flowchart TD
    C1[Client terminal 1] -->|TCP socket| S[Server process]
    C2[Client terminal 2] -->|TCP socket| S
    C3[Other clients] -->|TCP socket| S
    S --> A[accept loop]
    A --> T[pthread worker per client]
    T --> AUTH[Authentication + active-session check]
    AUTH --> RBAC[Role-based command dispatcher]
    RBAC --> STORE[store.c: data access layer]
    STORE --> U[(users.db)]
    STORE --> AC[(accounts.db)]
    STORE --> TX[(transactions.db)]
    STORE --> L[(loans.db)]
    STORE --> F[(feedback.db)]
    STORE --> J[(journal.db: PREPARED / COMMITTED)]
    STORE -.->|fcntl record locks| U
    STORE -.->|fcntl record locks| AC
    STORE -.->|fcntl record locks| TX
    STORE -.->|fcntl record locks| L
    STORE -.->|fcntl record locks| F
    STORE -.->|write-ahead log + startup redo| J
